                    "value": "AFEs, lines, phasing and decisions come from the Teduh Capex app (Dataverse) by a Copy job each night. Purchase orders, GL actuals and the capex budget come from the ERP extract. The notebook NB_TeduhCapex_Gold works out EAC, headroom and the supplement flag; a second Copy job sends them back to the app.",
